  "metadata": {
    "title": "UVIndoorLoc-RTT&RSSI: A New Multi-Scenario Dataset for Wi-Fi Fine Time Measurements Indoor Localization Problems",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.20051265",
    "publication_date": "2026-05-06",
    "description": "<div>\n<div>The <strong>UVIndoorLoc-RTT&amp;RSSI</strong> is a multi-scenario dataset with Wi-Fi Fine Time Measurements and RSSI measurements for indoor localization problems. The dataset covers a surface of 534 squared meters with 228 reference locations distributed over three scenarios. The measurements were collected using 3 different Android smartphones from 20 access points (APs) deployed in the scenarios.</div>\n</div>",
